<br>Programming prerequisites, listed in <a data-href="Coding Basics" href="level-0/coding-basics.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">Coding Basics</a> for now<br><a rel="noopener nofollow" class="external-link is-unresolved" href="https://docs.wpilib.org/en/stable/docs/software/commandbased/structuring-command-based-project.html" target="_self">https://docs.wpilib.org/en/stable/docs/software/commandbased/structuring-command-based-project.html</a>When you open a new robot project you'll see a lot of files we'll interact with.
